#11701
"Faint Path Through The Brush"
"These are the roots of a giant redwood.  You can tell by its thick trunk and
knotted, almost petrified bark that this must be a very old tree.  It is so
tall that it seems to go on forever and looking up from here you cannot see
past its boughs for they block the sky beyond.
"
""
