"Inside A Giant Redwood Tree"
"You emerge into a large, circularly hallowed out chamber.  There are several
softly glowing orbs, evenly spaced around the perimeter, that illuminate the
area.  The floor has been cut from the tree itself and polished to a glass-
like finish.  A large tapestry covers most of the eastern wall.  There is a
ladder leading up to a man-size hole cut into the ceiling.
"
