"A Large Comfortable Lounge"
"This is a large, cozy hall.  The only light comes from a fire blazing in the
stone hearth that is built into the northern wall.  An iron kettle in the
hearth emits a pleasant herbal aroma, that permeates the entire room.  The
floor is covered in soft, lush furs of all kinds.  There is a comfortable
looking couch along the western wall.  An unusual crack in the eastern wall
seems to break the harmony of the room.
"
